@startuml er-overview
!include _theme.puml
hide circle
hide empty methods
hide empty attributes
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 46
skinparam ranksep 54
' Logical entities and cardinalities only. Keys and columns are in the SDD.
entity "Account" as Account
entity "Job listing" as Job
entity "Profile" as Profile
entity "Match" as Match
entity "Tailored draft" as Draft
entity "Review packet" as Packet
entity "Application case" as Case
entity "Work run" as Run

Account -down-> Profile : owns
Profile -down-> Match : produces
Job -down-> Match : assessed in
Profile -down-> Draft : requests
Draft -down-> Packet : feeds
Job -right-> Packet : addressed to
Packet -down-> Case : becomes
Case -down-> Run : executed as

legend bottom
  A case is created from a review packet, never directly from a listing.
  One listing appears in many matches and drafts, one per account.
endlegend
@enduml